Sira: (This is the Manajah Antang's things.)
Sira: (A ritual to summon the Antang for guidance.)
Sira: (The Balian Bawi and elders interpret its message for us by watching every single little movement of the Antang.)
Sira: (We do it every once in a while, especially before making a big decision or facing a problem.)
Sira: (Like moving the village or opening new fields to farm.)
Sira: (Best not to touch it.)